second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which person or organization did Monica Fallon work for?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 81, \"text\": \"**Renowned Researcher Monica Fallon Leaves Lasting Legacy at Cardiff University**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 83, \"end\": 147, \"text\": \"Cardiff, UK - The academic community is mourning the loss of Dr.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 148, \"end\": 281, \"text\": \"Monica Fallon, a trailblazing researcher who spent over a decade at Cardiff University, leaving an indelible mark on the institution.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 282, \"end\": 444, \"text\": \"Fallon's groundbreaking work in her field has inspired a new generation of scholars, and her contributions to the university will be remembered for years to come.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 445, \"end\": 616, \"text\": \"During her tenure at Cardiff University, Fallon was a driving force behind several high-profile research projects, including a landmark study on climate change mitigation.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 617, \"end\": 757, \"text\": \"Her team's findings, published in the prestigious journal Nature, shed new light on the role of carbon capture in reducing global emissions.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 758, \"end\": 808, \"text\": \"\\\"Monica was a true pioneer in her field,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 809, \"end\": 860, \"text\": \"Rachel Jenkins, a colleague and friend of Fallon's.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 861, \"end\": 968, \"text\": \"\\\"Her passion and dedication to her work were contagious, and she inspired us all to strive for excellence.\\\"\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 969, \"end\": 1104, \"text\": \"Fallon's impact extended beyond the academic sphere, as her research had real-world implications for policymakers and industry leaders.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1105, \"end\": 1286, \"text\": \"Her work with the Welsh government helped inform environmental policy, and her collaborations with private companies led to the development of innovative, eco-friendly technologies.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1287, \"end\": 1463, \"text\": \"\\\"Monica was a brilliant scientist, but she was also an exceptional communicator,\\\" said Professor Mark Evans, Dean of the School of Environmental Sciences at Cardiff University.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1464, \"end\": 1590, \"text\": \"\\\"She had a unique ability to distill complex ideas into actionable solutions, making her a valuable asset to our institution.\\\"\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1591, \"end\": 1690, \"text\": \"Fallon's legacy is also reflected in the numerous awards and honors she received during her career.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1691, \"end\": 1856, \"text\": \"She was a recipient of the prestigious Royal Society Wolfson Research Merit Award and was named one of the UK's top 100 most influential women in science by the BBC.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1857, \"end\": 2060, \"text\": \"According to data from Cardiff University, Fallon's research group attracted over £5 million in funding during her tenure, supporting the work of dozens of graduate students and postdoctoral researchers.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2061, \"end\": 2165, \"text\": \"\\\"Monica's passing is a tremendous loss, but her work will continue to inspire and motivate us,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2166, \"end\": 2174, \"text\": \"Jenkins.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2175, \"end\": 2317, \"text\": \"\\\"Her legacy will live on through the countless lives she touched and the meaningful contributions she made to our understanding of the world.\\\"\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2318, \"end\": 2399, \"text\": \"Fallon is survived by her husband, John, and their two children, Emily and James.\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2400, \"end\": 2523, \"text\": \"A memorial service will be held at Cardiff University's Main Building on March 15th to celebrate her life and achievements.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 71, \"text\": \"Title: The Barcelona Connection: Unraveling the Career of Monica Fallon\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 73, \"end\": 204, \"text\": \"In the vibrant city of Barcelona, where the Mediterranean Sea meets the Pyrenees Mountains, a hub of scientific innovation thrives.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 205, \"end\": 423, \"text\": \"The Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona, a prestigious CSIC (Spanish National Research Council) institution, has been at the forefront of groundbreaking discoveries, pushing the boundaries of human knowledge.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 424, \"end\": 585, \"text\": \"It is here that our story begins, with a talented researcher named Monica Fallon, whose professional journey is inextricably linked to this esteemed institution.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 586, \"end\": 612, \"text\": \"Chapter 1: The Early Years\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 614, \"end\": 735, \"text\": \"Monica Fallon's fascination with the intricacies of human biology began during her undergraduate studies in biochemistry.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 736, \"end\": 816, \"text\": \"Her academic prowess and innate curiosity earned her a coveted spot in the Ph.D.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 817, \"end\": 856, \"text\": \"program at the University of Barcelona.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 857, \"end\": 1014, \"text\": \"As she delved deeper into the world of biomedical research, Monica's passion for understanding the complexities of human health and disease only intensified.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1015, \"end\": 1047, \"text\": \"Chapter 2: The Institute Beckons\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1049, \"end\": 1206, \"text\": \"In 2005, Monica's academic trajectory took a significant turn when she joined the Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona as a postdoctoral researcher.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1207, \"end\": 1386, \"text\": \"This move marked the beginning of a fruitful collaboration with the institute's esteemed scientists, who were renowned for their pioneering work in molecular biology and genetics.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1387, \"end\": 1567, \"text\": \"Monica's arrival at the institute coincided with a period of rapid growth and expansion, as the institution was poised to become a leading center for biomedical research in Europe.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1568, \"end\": 1601, \"text\": \"Chapter 3: A Researcher's Odyssey\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1603, \"end\": 1678, \"text\": \"During her tenure at the institute, Monica worked under the guidance of Dr.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1679, \"end\": 1751, \"text\": \"Maria Rodríguez, a distinguished expert in the field of cancer genetics.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1752, \"end\": 1892, \"text\": \"Together, they embarked on a series of projects aimed at elucidating the molecular mechanisms underlying cancer development and progression.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1893, \"end\": 2035, \"text\": \"Monica's contributions to these studies were instrumental in shedding light on the critical role of epigenetic modifications in tumorigenesis.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2036, \"end\": 2206, \"text\": \"Her research was met with acclaim, earning her several publications in prestigious scientific journals, including the Journal of Biological Chemistry and Cancer Research.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2207, \"end\": 2250, \"text\": \"Chapter 4: Collaborations and Breakthroughs\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2252, \"end\": 2410, \"text\": \"Monica's work at the institute was characterized by a spirit of collaboration, as she worked closely with colleagues from diverse backgrounds and disciplines.\"}, \"D2S22\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2411, \"end\": 2443, \"text\": \"One such collaboration, with Dr.\"}, \"D2S23\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2444, \"end\": 2590, \"text\": \"Juan Carlos Izpisúa Belmonte, a pioneer in the field of regenerative medicine, led to a groundbreaking discovery in the area of stem cell biology.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Monica Fallon\", \"scope\": \"work for\", \"claim\": \"Monica Fallon worked for the Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona.\", \"answer\": \"Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona\", \"quote\": \"In 2005, Monica's academic trajectory took a significant turn when she joined the Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona as a postdoctoral researcher.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Cardiff University\", \"Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Cardiff University\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
      }
